# Archive Agent Instructions

Read `AGENTS.md` first, then the nearest subtree `AGENTS.md`. They are the
canonical instruction files for this repository. This rule only adds
Cursor-specific reminders.

Important defaults:

- Active code lives in `apps/`, `packages/`, `native/kernel/`, and `skills/`.
- Follow subtree `AGENTS.md` files before editing internals.
- Keep `.waygent/`, `.agentlens/`, `.claude/`, `.codex-orchestrator/`,
  `.orchestrator/`, `.superpowers/`, caches, build outputs, and secrets out of
  git.
- Verify changes with the smallest relevant command and report the command
  result.
